# Sparkle moves superseded archives here once they drop out of the feed. They are no longer
# referenced by appcast.xml, so keeping them would grow the repo forever for nothing.
old_updates/

# Per-version release notes are the *input* to generate_appcast, which embeds them into
# appcast.xml as CDATA. They are read locally at release time and never need serving, so they stay
# out of the published repo — the notes people read live in the GitHub release and in Sparkle.
Intention-*.md
